OpenRide acknowledgment

OpenRide (https://github.com/Penthious/OpenRide) was the base example and
inspiration for OpenRun's on-device fitness experience, runner profiles,
entertainment workflow and optional Garmin integration.

OpenRun is an independent implementation. No OpenRide application source
code was copied into this repository. This acknowledgment credits the
reference project; it does not claim that OpenRun is a fork of OpenRide
or that OpenRide's authors endorse OpenRun.

OpenRun's license is in LICENSE. Dependency and build-tool references
are in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
